| **Total** | **26** | **33** | **33** | **7** | **99** |

> [!CAUTION]
> The database has **no schema version control**, **no migration files**, **no RLS policies**, and **no foreign key evidence** in the codebase. The entire schema is an implicit contract between the frontend code and whatever was manually created in the Supabase dashboard. This is a deployment risk of the highest order.

