### 2.5 `recruitment_posts` vs `job_forms` — Dual Job Posting System

> [!WARNING]
> **HIGH-DB-01: Two completely separate job posting tables exist.**
>
> - `job_forms` — Created by HR in [ATSScanner.tsx](file:///c:/Users/veere/Downloads/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/Task-Flow-Tracker-hackathon/flowtracker/src/pages/hr/recruitment/ATSScanner.tsx). Columns: `job_title`, `form_schema`, `jd_text`, `status`, `form_style`, `requires_assessment`.
